{"unit_id": "tag:06QL:title", "translation": "性质下降（descending）的变体", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "descending", "target_term": "下降"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "descending", "target_term": "下降", "context": "性质下降这一操作，待决"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:06QL:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n有时可以对并非局部（local）的性质作下降（descend）。本节收集这类结果。也参见第<REF_0001>节，其中讨论态射（morphisms）的性质，例如光滑性（smoothness）的下降（descending）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "descend", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "smoothness", "target_term": "光滑性"}, {"source_term": "descending", "target_term": "下降"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部", "context": "性质的局部性，待决"}, {"source_term": "descend", "target_term": "下降", "context": "性质下降的动词，待决"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "具有所讨论性质的态射，待决"}, {"source_term": "smoothness", "target_term": "光滑性", "context": "可下降的态射性质，待决"}, {"source_term": "descending", "target_term": "下降", "context": "引用节讨论的操作，待决"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:06QM:statement", "translation": "若<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）之间的平坦（flat）且满射（surjective）的态射（morphism），并且<MATH_0002>既约（reduced），则<MATH_0003>既约（reduced）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "reduced", "target_term": "既约"}, {"source_term": "reduced", "target_term": "既约"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的源和目标，待决"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "态射条件，待决"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "态射条件，待决"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "概形态射，待决"}, {"source_term": "reduced", "target_term": "既约", "context": "所下降的概形性质，待决"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:06QM:proof", "translation": "考察局部环（local rings）（概形（Schemes）定义<REF_0001>），并利用代数（Algebra）引理<REF_0002>，即可得到结果。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "概形的局部环，待决"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引用章节名，待决"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "引用章节名，待决"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:06QN:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism）。若<MATH_0002>局部有限表现（locally of finite presentation）、平坦（flat）且满射（surjective），而<MATH_0003>正则（regular），则<MATH_0004>正则（regular）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表现"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "regular", "target_term": "正则"}, {"source_term": "regular", "target_term": "正则"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间", "context": "原文指定的对象，待决"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "代数空间态射，待决"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表现", "context": "态射有限性，待决"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "态射条件，待决"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "态射条件，待决"}, {"source_term": "regular", "target_term": "正则", "context": "下降的正则性，待决"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:06QN:proof", "translation": "该引理化归为如下代数（algebra）陈述：若<MATH_0001>是忠实平坦（faithfully flat）、有限表现（finitely presented）的环（ring）同态（homomorphism），且<MATH_0002>诺特（Noetherian）并正则（regular），则<MATH_0003>诺特（Noetherian）并正则（regular）。由代数（Algebra）引理<REF_0001>可知，<MATH_0004>诺特（Noetherian）；由代数（Algebra）引理<REF_0002>可知，它正则（regular）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "faithfully flat", "target_term": "忠实平坦"}, {"source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限表现"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "regular", "target_term": "正则"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "regular", "target_term": "正则"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "regular", "target_term": "正则"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "化归后的代数陈述，待决"}, {"source_term": "faithfully flat", "target_term": "忠实平坦", "context": "环同态条件，待决"}, {"source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限表现", "context": "环同态有限性，待决"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "所考虑的环，待决"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态", "context": "环之间的同态，待决"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "环的诺特性，待决"}, {"source_term": "regular", "target_term": "正则", "context": "环的正则性，待决"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "引用章节名，待决"}], "notes": []}
